    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110590" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φερσέφασσα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Περσέφασσα, Περσεφόνη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				894
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				175
			</span></i> (lyr.): 
				Att.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φερρέφαττα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				287
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ra.</u>
				671
			</span></i> (with vv. ll.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				404c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				404d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hesperia</u>
				4.21
			</span></i> (Athens, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>); also 
				Dor.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν Φερρέφατταν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicr.
					9.3
				</span></i>
			; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φερσεφάασσα</span></b>  Epigr.
			ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				843b27
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φερσεφάσσια</span></b> , τά, festival at
			Cyzicus, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				4.949
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Chios</span>). (Etym. uncertain: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ τὸ φέρβειν τὴν φάτταν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					4.16
				</span></i>
			.)</div>
